## 6. 数据库表结构（16张核心表）

| 表名 | 说明 | 关键字段 |
|------|------|---------|
| user | 用户 | id/username(UNIQUE)/password/role/nickname/avatar_url/motto |
| knowledge | 知识库 | id/title/content/category/keywords/view_count |
| question_log | 问答日志 | id/user_id/question/source/created_at |
| forum_post | 帖子 | id/title/content/tags/view_count/like_count/favorite_count/comment_count |
| forum_comment | 评论 | id/post_id/content/parent_id/like_count |
| forum_like | 帖子点赞 | post_id/user_id (UNIQUE) |
| forum_favorite | 收藏 | user_id/post_id (UNIQUE) |
| forum_comment_like | 评论赞 | comment_id/user_id (UNIQUE) |
| contribution | 投稿 | id/question/answer/status |
| knowledge_gap | 知识缺口 | id/question(UNIQUE)/answer/source/urls/search_count/status |
| knowledge_history | 版本历史 | id/knowledge_id/title/content/category/keywords |
| notification | 通知 | id/user_id/type/content/post_id/is_read |
| feedback | 反馈 | id/question/answer/source/helpful |
| hot_keyword | 热词 | id/keyword(UNIQUE)/search_count |
| sensitive_word | 敏感词 | id/word |

